<title>PHILIPPINES: Aboitiz Equity 1996 net at 1.085 bln pesos.</title>
<headline>Aboitiz Equity 1996 net at 1.085 bln pesos.</headline>
<text>
<p>MANILA, March 14 - Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>	    (in million pesos unless stated)</p>
<p>    Turnover (billion)	  3.338 vs 2.952</p>
<p>    Net income (billion)	1.085 vs 1.077</p>
<p>Note: Full name Aboitiz Equity Ventures Inc. The company is a holding firm engaged in power, banking and financial services.</p>
<p>It said net income improved by a mere one percent due to a decline in interest income as additional funds were invested in new projects that were not yet operational. The 1996 figures are unaudited.  -- Manila newsroom (632) 841-8937</p>
</text>
